./docs/WORK-ORDERS-archive.md:118:- [x] **BW-02 (MERGED a403de7) — Autonomous mode: keeps pausing, never progresses.** ROOT CAUSE CONFIRMED (trace `conv_20fa8482`): NOT a stale-counter bug — the actionless valve (turn_control.py:168-216, cap 3) + counter resets (consecutive_noops signals.py:215-219, _invisible_steps engine.py:995) all work; NOT the bare-RUNNING twin. REAL cause: the K1 elision-guard went BLIND to a MODEL-PARAPHRASED placeholder. Model copied `<content elided — re-issue the call or file_read the path...>` into a file_write body; `_ELISION_MARKER_RE` (events.py:318) requires a `\d+ chars` anchor, which the paraphrase dropped → guard passed it → 132 bytes overwrote js/shell.js → read_before_write error → model spirals into tool-less turns that re-trip the valve each resume segment. Same class as [[disco-runthru-v2-snipargs-keystone]]. FIX: (1) PRIMARY — broaden `_ELISION_MARKER_RE` (events.py:318) to match the marker by its STRUCTURAL tail ('re-issue the call or file_read the path' / 'do not copy this placeholder') without the `N chars` anchor, so a paraphrased placeholder is still rejected at observe.py:259 before it overwrites a file. (2) SECONDARY — escalate repeated actionless re-pauses (N consecutive, zero productive actions since resume) to STUCK or a single steered recovery instead of silently looping forever.
./docs/WORK-ORDERS-archive.md:128:- [x] **BW-08 (MERGED) — "Untitled" projects flood History.** ROOT CAUSE (NOT a titler bug — titler correctly no-ops on 0-event convs): the Build/Agent surface EAGERLY pre-creates a server-side conversation row on MOUNT (before any task) to render the upload paperclip — useBuild.ts:54-61 `preCreate.mutate` + ensurePreCid :93-99 → POST /conversations → store.create_conversation persists title=None immediately. Abandoned (navigate away / preCid race) → orphaned 0-event rows that surface in History (conversations.ts:21 `title ?? "(untitled)"`). EVIDENCE: 25/25 NULL-title build + 271/271 NULL-title agent convs have EXACTLY 0 events; created in ~6ms pairs (empty + real). FIX: (a) lazy pre-create (don't persist a row until first real signal/submit/upload, reuse one cid), and/or (b) reap 0-event/IDLE convs (extend the P-C reap `b31bf71`), and/or (c) filter 0-event convs from the History/Projects listing queries.
./docs/WORK-ORDERS-archive.md:137:- [x] **BW-15 (MERGED 70aad37) — Auto-foreground the Edit/Export tab on slides completion** [feature]. SEAM: inspector tab state lives in AgentCanvas.tsx (`tab` useState :637, TabId incl `deck` :27; deck tab present when `editableDeckBase=latestEditableDeckBase(events)` non-null :646-653). Copy the existing auto-switch-to-browser effect (:640-642 `if(hasScreenshots) setTab('browser')`): add a sibling useEffect keyed on `editableDeckBase` absent→present (useRef to remember prev base so it fires only on a NEW deck, doesn't fight manual clicks). Handle ordering vs the hasScreenshots→browser effect (deck switch should win for a slides build).
