./docs/codex-evidence-harness-review-6-21-26.md:15097:The Playwright helpers have several endpoint-shape mismatches: state, events, artifact URLs, and trace span field names. Since the current smoke only checks helper importability, those mismatches are not caught.
./docs/codex-evidence-harness-review-6-21-26.md:15274:- **P0/P1: the Playwright evidence helpers use wrong API shapes.** `/events` returns a page object with an `events` array: [conversations.py](/var/home/dylan/projects/disco/packages/agent-server/src/disco/agent_server/routes/conversations.py:173), but `discoClick` parses it like JSONL/top-level events: [discoClick.ts](/var/home/dylan/projects/disco/frontend/e2e-full/support/discoClick.ts:123). Assertions have the same shape bug: [assertions.ts](/var/home/dylan/projects/disco/frontend/e2e-full/support/assertions.ts:122). Artifact checks use `/workspace/{path}` instead of `/conversations/{cid}/artifacts/{path}`: [assertions.ts](/var/home/dylan/projects/disco/frontend/e2e-full/support/assertions.ts:249). State collection omits the conversation id: [artifactCollector.ts](/var/home/dylan/projects/disco/frontend/e2e-full/support/artifactCollector.ts:31). Trace assertions check `name`, but spans are emitted as `span`: [obs.py](/var/home/dylan/projects/disco/packages/core/src/disco/core/obs.py:67), [assertions.ts](/var/home/dylan/projects/disco/frontend/e2e-full/support/assertions.ts:211).
./docs/codex-evidence-harness-review-6-21-26.md:15295:- W11 smoke tests mostly prove helper imports, not that helpers correctly verify backend evidence. `discoClick` records `status_found/ws_found/events_found` but does not fail when expected evidence is missing: [discoClick.ts](/var/home/dylan/projects/disco/frontend/e2e-full/support/discoClick.ts:253).
./docs/codex-evidence-harness-review-6-21-26.md:15317:- **P0/P1: the Playwright evidence helpers use wrong API shapes.** `/events` returns a page object with an `events` array: [conversations.py](/var/home/dylan/projects/disco/packages/agent-server/src/disco/agent_server/routes/conversations.py:173), but `discoClick` parses it like JSONL/top-level events: [discoClick.ts](/var/home/dylan/projects/disco/frontend/e2e-full/support/discoClick.ts:123). Assertions have the same shape bug: [assertions.ts](/var/home/dylan/projects/disco/frontend/e2e-full/support/assertions.ts:122). Artifact checks use `/workspace/{path}` instead of `/conversations/{cid}/artifacts/{path}`: [assertions.ts](/var/home/dylan/projects/disco/frontend/e2e-full/support/assertions.ts:249). State collection omits the conversation id: [artifactCollector.ts](/var/home/dylan/projects/disco/frontend/e2e-full/support/artifactCollector.ts:31). Trace assertions check `name`, but spans are emitted as `span`: [obs.py](/var/home/dylan/projects/disco/packages/core/src/disco/core/obs.py:67), [assertions.ts](/var/home/dylan/projects/disco/frontend/e2e-full/support/assertions.ts:211).
